silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_01_bridge_to_yoneda_lemma_concrete_anchor#mittensfullhomprofile a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.05_granite_substrate.chapters.08_cross_paper_bridges.sections.01_bridge_to_yoneda_lemma.concrete_anchor#mittensfullhomprofile" .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_01_bridge_to_yoneda_lemma_concrete_anchor#mittensfullhomprofile silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensFullHomProfile is the incoming-arrow profile of the governed Mittens individual: type probes (to Cat), quality probes (body mass 4.3 kg), process probes (vet exam participation), role probes (clinic patient at Tartu clinic), taxonomy probes (Felis catus/TSN 183798), evidence probes (vet record), validation probes — the full rich profile that distinguishes Mittens from any storage row." .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_01_bridge_to_yoneda_lemma_concrete_anchor#graniterownarrowhomprofile a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.05_granite_substrate.chapters.08_cross_paper_bridges.sections.01_bridge_to_yoneda_lemma.concrete_anchor#graniterownarrowhomprofile" .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_01_bridge_to_yoneda_lemma_concrete_anchor#graniterownarrowhomprofile silm:hasLongDescription "The GraniteRowNarrowHomProfile is the narrow incoming-arrow profile of chunk c-0x7f4a: hash-verification probes, manifest-entry probes, return-path probes only — a strict subset of the Mittens profile, confirming the chunk is not Mittens." .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_01_bridge_to_yoneda_lemma_concrete_anchor#yonedaembeddingongranitedomain a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.05_granite_substrate.chapters.08_cross_paper_bridges.sections.01_bridge_to_yoneda_lemma.concrete_anchor#yonedaembeddingongranitedomain" .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_01_bridge_to_yoneda_lemma_concrete_anchor#yonedaembeddingongranitedomain silm:hasLongDescription "The YonedaEmbeddingOnGraniteDomain is the Yoneda embedding from the Granite category to the presheaf category: maps each object (Mittens, GraniteRow, VetCarePlan_77, etc.) to its represented presheaf Hom(-,X). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Y (Yoneda embedding)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_01_bridge_to_yoneda_lemma_concrete_anchor#yonedalemmapapercrossref a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.05_granite_substrate.chapters.08_cross_paper_bridges.sections.01_bridge_to_yoneda_lemma.concrete_anchor#yonedalemmapapercrossref" .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_01_bridge_to_yoneda_lemma_concrete_anchor#yonedalemmapapercrossref silm:hasLongDescription "The YonedaLemmaPaperCrossRef is the encyclopedia entry 14_yoneda_lemma, which proves the abstract Yoneda lemma: the Yoneda embedding is full and faithful, so any object is characterized by its Hom-profile and different Hom-profiles guarantee different objects." .
